ne fact as evidence. Provide maybe \"Candidate C keeps calm in a crisis\" and \"can make correct decisions quickly\". Also note concern: difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric. Then state provisional recommendation for Candidate C, but note need to discuss others.\n\nLet's produce public message accordingly."}
